  <data name="AreasDescription" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>The areas to purge, all of them except LowPriorityStandbyList when none is given:
* WorkingSet, empties the working set of every process.
* SystemFileCache, flushes the working set of the system file cache.
* ModifiedPageList, writes modified pages out and moves them to the standby list.
* StandbyList, purges the standby list.
* LowPriorityStandbyList, purges only the lowest priority standby pages.
* CombinedPageList, combines identical physical pages.
* RegistryCache, writes modified registry hive data out.
* VolumeCache, flushes the cached writes of every fixed volume.</value>
